f 17592186046673 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418995 #edb/ref 1049 #edb/ref 17592186049064 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418995 #edb/ref 1053 #uuid "71036dcd-e882-527a-9681-dd5cc25371dc" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418996 #edb/ref 1080 "multiplication of $f\\in A$ by a scalar is not closed" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418996 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418996 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "313cdc82-5d69-5af4-95bb-ace914a012ac" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418997 #edb/ref 1080 "addition of functions in $A$  is not associative" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418997 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418997 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "4f43eb35-6698-556b-937a-7540b2eaa194" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418998 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{A1}$, $\\text{A3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418998 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418998 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "54174a8e-4b9f-5398-9c3e-042309cf5af7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418999 #edb/ref 1080 "addition of functions in $A$  is not commutative" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418999 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186418999 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "54d7d70f-b06b-5dba-8920-ce4be2335648" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419000 #edb/ref 1080 "$1\\cdot f\\ne f$ for some $f\\in A$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419000 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419000 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "61ff392f-4de3-5c34-9123-789573d772b5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419001 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{A4}$, $\\text{A3}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419001 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419001 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "7c55b42e-8e25-5d4a-9c6c-fb23853f6637" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419002 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{A5}$, $\\text{A4}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419002 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419002 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "923e4cd4-7cb7-513f-a013-6b459182a21c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419003 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{A3}$, $\\text{A4}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419003 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419003 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c5a112ad-76a7-5358-b6fe-7be7dc9072ca" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419004 #edb/ref 1080 "$\\text{A1}$, $\\text{A2}$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419004 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419004 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "edaa960c-9666-5ef7-ae8f-8608f1b827e8" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419005 #edb/ref 1080 "addition and scalar multiplication of functions  in $A$ do not satisfy the distributive laws" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419005 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045499 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419005 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f187a6fa-78fb-565f-9a52-c1915abb65f1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418996 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418997 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186418999 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419000 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186419005 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186418996 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419006 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "4628fceb-08d9-5ba5-86ad-00d444e18706" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419007 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186419006 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419007 #edb/ref 1069 "q-94792" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419007 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419007 #edb/ref 1071 "Let $A$ be the set of all functions $f:R\\to R$ of the form  $f(x)=a+{x}^{2},$ where $a\\in R.$ Complete the following sentence:\n\n*$A$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to function addition and scalar multiplication) because $\\text{_________}\\,.$*" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419007 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "1a47334c-0a05-5b9c-b7eb-76cf4c1d5cfb" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419007 #edb/ref 1074 "The correct answer is as follows:\n\n*$A$ is **not** a vector space (with respect to function addition and scalar multiplication) because **multiplication of $f\\in A$ by a scalar is not closed.** *\n\nFor example, if $\\alpha =2$ and $f(x)={x}^{2},$ then $\\alpha f(x)=2{x}^{2}.$ So, $\\alpha f(x)\\notin A$ because the coefficient of ${x}^{2}$ is not $1.$\n\nOn the other hand:\n\n- Addition of real valued functions  is associative. $\\,✓$\n\n- Addition and scalar multiplication of polynomials satisfy the distributive laws.\n$\\,✓$\n\n- Addition of real valued functions  is commutative. $\\,✓$\n\n- $1\\cdot f=f$ for all $f\\in A.$ $\\,✓$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419008 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186419010 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419008 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "2f729f32-9ccf-5071-9aab-348325a597e5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419008 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186184764 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419009 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "4418ef90-81d3-58b0-a3d7-e0c226069037" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419009 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186419007 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419010 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186419009 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419010 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "8de51b15-aacb-5258-b556-fea43597fd8c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186419010 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186385324 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
